{"title": "Homing Weapon", "pageid": 20470, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Homing_Weapon", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Homing_weapons\" title=\"Homing weapons\">Homing weapons</a>        </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Homing Weapon</b> is a passive feature that sends the weapon back to its owner after being thrown.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>This weapon will return to its owner when thrown. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dwarven_Thrower\" title=\"Dwarven Thrower\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Warhammer_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Warhammer_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e4/Warhammer_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Warhammer_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e4/Warhammer_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Warhammer_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Warhammer_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Warhammer_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e4/Warhammer_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Dwarven_Thrower\" title=\"Dwarven Thrower\">Dwarven Thrower</a></span></li><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Returning_Pike\" title=\"Returning Pike\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Pike_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Pike_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c2/Pike_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Pike_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c2/Pike_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Pike_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Pike_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Pike_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c2/Pike_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Returning_Pike\" title=\"Returning Pike\">Returning Pike</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Once a weapon with the Homing Weapon passive is dropped, this passive will not show if the weapon is examined while it is on the ground. Aditionally, when a dropped weapon with this passive is subsequently picked up and thrown (regardless of which character throws it), it will return to the <i>Main Hand</i> (melee) of the character who initially dropped the item.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201500\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.042 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.050 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1301/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 12332/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2999/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/75